0..76 Comment "//! A returner\'s row is a row of interfaces: each interface\'s name holds its"
77..156 Comment "//! signature, no name twice, the names in no order of their own. Two rows that"
157..235 Comment "//! list the same interfaces in different orders are one row, sequencing joins"
236..315 Comment "//! the rows of the computations it runs, and a computation is read where a row"
316..370 Comment "//! holding more is asked: the set operations of a row"
371..453 Comment "//! [Hillerström-2016-liberating_effects_rows_handlers], § 2. What refuses is in"
454..505 Comment "//! `../../pathological/control/effect-rows.gandr`."
506..509 Comment "//!"
510..526 Comment "//! - see: #2269"
527..592 Comment "//! - cites: [Hillerström-2016-liberating_effects_rows_handlers]"
